      "description": {
        "text": "The only Base Set Machamp without the 1st Edition stamp, and the only one that isn't holo. Every other English copy of the card is a 1st Edition holo from a starter set; this one came in Trainer Deck A, a deck Wizards of the Coast made for the first Pokémon Leagues and never sold. Like the rest of the deck, it has a red border and \"Trainer Deck A\" in red on the back.",
